notice-error-task-save = Task changes could not be saved. Check server disk space and permissions, then retry. Cancellation signals still take effect; after restart, the last saved state applies.
notice-error-task-bindings = Local task attachment bindings are damaged or changed externally. Original records are preserved; submissions and automatic imports are paused. Back up your Zotero profile, check taskBindings and taskBindingsBackup, restore the bindings, then restart Zotero.
